  "title": "Material Wonderland — Highlight Reel",
  "summary": "Material Wonderland, Lu Yang’s first solo exhibition of NFT-backed work, co-curated by Alice Scope and Barry Threw for Vellum LA and Feral File, features eight new works from “The Great Adventure of Material World.”\n\nThis exhibition explores the transformative potential of video games as sites for enacting and exploring identity, especially as online spaces increasingly shape our modes of being. Lu Yang resists viewing virtual worlds as mere escapism, instead presenting an interactive narrative as a \"technology-of-the-self\" for reconstructing identity.\n\n“The Great Adventure of Material World” is structured around Buddhist reincarnations, inviting viewers to explore identity transformations as “The Knight.” The game challenges players to reflect on societal views and explore alternate paths of being, offering infinite possibilities for existence liberated from rigid confines of nationality, gender, and sexuality.\n\nThe NFT-backed video loops in this collection are rendered from within the game, showcasing different enactments of The Knight and transformative scenes, chosen by the artist as evocative moments in the player's ultimate metamorphosis.",
